        "r": 541.5052920000011,
        "b": 687.8032529281769
      },
      "content": "Secure  the  rotation  cylinder  to  cylinder  adaptor  using  bolts  and  connecting  tube  to cylinder using the connecting nut."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1165",
      "reading_order": 1499,
      "section": "3-7-2. Adjustment",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.679292,
        "t": 679.6950800000001,
        "r": 351.7785959999994,
        "b": 670.823360928177
      },
      "content": "When assembling them, adjust the trembling."
    },
